  "selected_contracts": {
    "scipy_random_table": "Ideal logpmf=sumlogfactorial(row)+sumlogfactorial(col)-logfactorial(total)-sumlogfactorial(cells);thus factorially weighted independent-sample conditional tablelaw,not uniform integer matrices. Params/output np.int64;Patefieldusesdouble arithmetic/RNG,not arbitrary binary/fairbitmachine proof. No scalar cap or structural-zero parameter observed.",
    "networkx_min_cost_flow": "Returns network_simplex(...)[1],one minimum-cost feasibleflow. Demand is inflow-outflow,opposite F115 beta outflow-inflow. Missing capacity defaults infinity,whereas countcorollaryrequires finitebounds. Objectiveweights and optimum output not all-feasible uniformlaw/count. Integer-rescaling workaround preserves optimization differently from countunits;not automatically legitimate for configurationcounts."
  },
